# Packages (lines beginning "#" are comments)
 &PACKAGES
 useDiagnostics=.TRUE.,
 useGMRedi=.TRUE.,
# KPP and MNC are not compiled (commented out in code/packages.conf), so their flags keep the
# default .FALSE.; a flag set .TRUE. for a package that is not compiled stops the model at
# start-up. Set them again only together with the package:
#   KPP: uncomment kpp in code/packages.conf, restore input/data.kpp (git history), and comment
#        out ivdc_kappa in data (convective adjustment and KPP should not both act), then
# useKPP=.TRUE.,
#   MNC (netCDF output): uncomment mnc in code/packages.conf, then
# useMNC=.TRUE.,
 &
